<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="admin-csrf" content="<?= esc($csrf,'attr') ?>"><title>Primeserve Customer Administration</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/brand.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/portal.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/customer.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/admin-dashboard.css?v=queues-2"><script src="/customer-admin.js?v=open-queues-1-standard-special-1-block-unblock-1-wallet-debit-1-refund-1-split-reports-recent-50-wallet-credit-usage-gstin-save-popup-1" defer></script><link rel="stylesheet" href="/save-popup.css?v=1"><script src="/save-popup.js?v=refund-1-1" defer></script></head><body><header class="brand-header"><div class="brand-wrap header-inner"><a href="/"><img class="brand-logo-image" src="/primeserve-logo.png" alt="Primeserve Global Solution Pvt. Ltd."></a></div></header><main class="workspace customer-workspace"><nav class="admin-tabs" aria-label="Administration"><button type="button" data-admin-tab="home" aria-pressed="true">Home</button><button type="button" data-admin-tab="customers" aria-pressed="false">Customers</button><button type="button" data-admin-tab="payments" aria-pressed="false">Payments</button><button type="button" data-admin-tab="pricing" aria-pressed="false">Pricing</button><button type="button" data-admin-tab="reports" aria-pressed="false">Reports</button><button type="button" data-admin-tab="settings" aria-pressed="false">Settings</button><a href="/admin/activity">API Activity</a><button type="button" id="adminLogout">Logout</button></nav><section class="portal-card admin-dashboard"><div class="admin-title"><div><p class="card-eyebrow">PRIMESERVE ADMIN</p><h1 id="adminPageTitle">Overview</h1></div><button type="button" class="secondary-action" id="refreshAdmin">Refresh</button></div><p id="accountNotice" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><section data-admin-panel="home"><p class="admin-intro">Manage customers, approve payments and download reports.</p><div id="adminOverview" class="metrics"></div><div class="admin-shortcuts"><button data-admin-go="payments">Approve a payment →</button><button data-admin-go="customers">Manage a customer →</button><button data-admin-go="reports">Download Excel →</button></div><p id="configurationStatus"></p><p id="bonusSummary"></p><small>Dashboard lists show up to 50 recent records. Use Reports for full date-range exports.</small></section><section data-admin-panel="customers" hidden><details open><summary>Block / Unblock Customer</summary><p>Blocking prevents login and immediately revokes all existing customer sessions. Open portal pages return to Login within 5 seconds while active, or when reopened. Unblocking permits a fresh login. Balances and history are preserved. The reason is shown on blocked login and emailed to the customer when blocking or unblocking.</p><form data-action="access" class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label>Customer<select name="id" data-customers required></select></label></div><div class="field"><label>Action<select name="operation" required><option value="">Choose action</option><option value="block">Block account</option><option value="unblock">Unblock account</option></select></label></div><div class="field"><label>Reason<input name="reason" required minlength="5" maxlength="300"></label></div><button class="primary-action">Save account access</button></form></details><details><summary>Prepaid / Postpaid &amp; Credit Limit</summary><p>Changing billing mode signs the customer out. Only Admin can enable postpaid credit.</p><form data-action="customer" class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label>Customer<select name="id" data-customers required></select></label></div><div class="field"><label>Billing mode<select name="mode"><option>PREPAID</option><option>POSTPAID</option></select></label></div><div class="field"><label>Postpaid credit limit (₹)<input name="creditLimit" value="0" required inputmode="decimal"></label></div><div class="field"><label>Payment terms (days)<input name="termsDays" type="number" min="1" max="365" value="30" required></label></div><label><input name="enabled" type="checkbox" checked disabled> Account enabled (change using Block / Unblock above)</label><button class="primary-action">Save customer billing</button></form></details><details><summary>Customer Billing GST Details</summary><p>View GST details in the Customers table. Edit or delete current billing details here; historical charges remain unchanged.</p><form data-action="billing-details" class="form-grid" id="adminGstForm"><div class="field"><label>Customer<select name="id" data-customers required></select></label></div><div class="field"><label>Operation<select name="operation"><option value="save">Save / Edit GST details</option><option value="delete">Delete billing GST details</option></select></label></div><div class="field"><label>Billing state code<input name="state" maxlength="2" pattern="[0-9]{2}"></label></div><div class="field"><label>Billing GSTIN<input name="gstin" maxlength="15"></label></div><button class="primary-action">Save GST details</button></form></details><div data-admin-tables="customers"></div></section><section data-admin-panel="payments" hidden><details><summary>Reduce Wallet Balance / Correct Wrong Credit</summary><p>Use this to correct an incorrect wallet credit. This reduces available prepaid balance; it does not send a refund or change historical payments. Held API and refund funds remain protected.</p><form data-action="wallet-debit" class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label>Customer<select name="id" data-customers required></select></label></div><div class="field"><label>Amount to reduce (₹)<input name="amount" required inputmode="decimal" pattern="[0-9]+([.][0-9]{1,2})?" placeholder="e.g. 100.00"></label></div><div class="field"><label>Correction reason<input name="reason" required minlength="5" maxlength="300" placeholder="Explain the incorrect credit being corrected"></label></div><label><input name="confirmed" type="checkbox" required> I checked the customer and amount and confirm this will reduce their balance</label><input name="requestId" type="hidden"><button class="primary-action">Reduce balance</button></form></details><details><summary>Refund Requests — Review</summary><p>Customer must submit the portal request AND email complete details with a valid reason to support@primeserve.in. No automatic email is sent. Check the Refund Requests table for the customer, reason and UPI. Approve only the eligible amount. The unapproved remainder is released to the wallet.</p><p id="refundReviewDetails" class="refund-details"></p><form data-action="refund-review" class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label>Pending refund<select name="id" id="pendingRefunds" required></select></label></div><div class="field"><label>Decision<select name="decision" required><option value="approve">Approve amount</option><option value="reject">Reject request</option></select></label></div><div class="field"><label>Final approved amount (₹; enter 0 to reject)<input name="amount" required inputmode="decimal" value="0"></label></div><div class="field"><label>Review reason<input name="reason" required minlength="5" maxlength="1000"></label></div><label><input name="emailReceived" type="checkbox"> I received and checked the customer's required email at support@primeserve.in</label><button class="primary-action">Save refund decision</button></form></details><details><summary>Refunds — Record Manual Transfer</summary><p>Transfer only the approved amount to the verified refund destination yourself. This portal does not send money. Record the successful transfer below; wallet funds will not be deducted twice.</p><p id="refundTransferDetails" class="refund-details"></p><form data-action="refund-paid" class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label>Approved refund<select name="id" id="approvedRefunds" required></select></label></div><div class="field"><label>Transfer UTR / Bank reference<input name="reference" required minlength="6" maxlength="64"></label></div><label><input name="transferConfirmed" type="checkbox" required> I verified the manual transfer succeeded for the approved amount and destination</label><button class="primary-action">Mark refund paid</button></form></details><details><summary>Add Balance to Customer Wallet</summary><p>Admin-authorized prepaid wallet credit. This does not record a bank payment. Use recharge approval for money actually received.</p><form data-action="wallet-credit" class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label>Customer<select name="id" data-customers required></select></label></div><div class="field"><label>Amount (&#8377;)<input name="amount" required inputmode="decimal" pattern="[0-9]+([.][0-9]{1,2})?" placeholder="e.g. 100.00"></label></div><div class="field"><label>Reason<input name="reason" required minlength="5" maxlength="300" placeholder="Reason for granting wallet credit"></label></div><input name="requestId" type="hidden"><button class="primary-action">Add balance</button></form></details><details open><summary>Approve or Reject a Recharge</summary><p>Verify actual receipt in the business bank account. UTR submissions or screenshots alone are not proof.</p><form data-action="recharge" class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label>Pending request<select name="id" id="pendingRecharges" required></select></label></div><div class="field"><label>Decision<select name="decision" required><option value="">Choose a decision</option><option value="approve">Approve payment</option><option value="reject">Reject payment</option></select></label></div><label><input name="bankVerified" type="checkbox"> I independently verified receipt in the bank account</label><div class="field"><label>Reason<input name="reason" maxlength="300" required></label></div><button class="primary-action">Record decision</button></form></details><details><summary>Review Held API Charges</summary><p>Check the provider before releasing or charging held funds. Never retry a chargeable request merely because its response was lost.</p><form data-action="review" class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label>Held request<select name="requestKey" id="heldRequests" required></select></label></div><div class="field"><label>Verified outcome<select name="outcome"><option value="released">Release reservation</option><option value="charged">Charge accepted request</option></select></label></div><div class="field"><label>Review evidence / reason<input name="reason" required minlength="5" maxlength="300"></label></div><button class="primary-action">Resolve reservation</button></form></details><details><summary>Record Postpaid Payment</summary><form data-action="postpaid-payment" class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label>Customer<select name="id" data-customers required></select></label></div><div class="field"><label>Amount (₹)<input name="amount" required inputmode="decimal"></label></div><div class="field"><label>Bank reference<input name="reference" required minlength="6" maxlength="64"></label></div><label><input name="bankVerified" type="checkbox" required> Receipt independently verified</label><button class="primary-action">Record payment</button></form></details><div data-admin-tables="payments"></div></section><section data-admin-panel="pricing" hidden><details open><summary>Standard Service Prices</summary><p>Change standard rates for existing and new clients. Client-specific special rates and previous charges stay unchanged. Prices below exclude GST.</p><form data-action="settings" id="standardPriceForm" class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label>Service<select name="name"><option value="price_returns">GST Return</option><option value="price_challan-monthly">Challan Monthly</option><option value="price_challan-yearly">Challan Yearly</option><option value="price_certificate">GST Certificate</option></select></label></div><div class="field"><label>Standard price excluding GST (₹)<input name="value" required inputmode="decimal" pattern="[0-9]+([.][0-9]{1,2})?"></label></div><button class="primary-action">Update standard price</button></form></details><details><summary>Customer API Prices &amp; Access</summary><p>Choose Special fixed rate to protect this client from standard price changes, or Standard rate to follow the current and future standard price for this service.</p><form data-action="price" class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label>Customer<select name="id" data-customers required></select></label></div><div class="field"><label>Service<select name="service"><option value="returns">GST Return</option><option value="challan-monthly">Challan Monthly</option><option value="challan-yearly">Challan Yearly</option><option value="certificate">Certificate</option></select></label></div><div class="field"><label>Pricing mode<select name="pricingMode"><option value="special">Special fixed rate</option><option value="standard">Standard rate</option></select></label></div><div class="field"><label>Price excluding GST (₹)<input name="net" required inputmode="decimal"></label></div><label><input name="enabled" type="checkbox" checked> Service enabled</label><button class="primary-action">Update fixed price</button></form></details><div data-admin-tables="pricing"></div></section><section data-admin-panel="reports" hidden><div class="admin-report-card"><h2>Download Excel Reports</h2><p>Choose a report and date range. Both dates are included (Indian time). Customer reports use the registration date; other reports use the transaction date. Large reports download as a ZIP with numbered Excel files of up to 100,000 records each.</p><form data-action="excel" class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label>Report<select name="kind"><option value="refunds">Refund Requests</option><option value="payments">Payments &amp; Recharges</option><option value="customers">Customer Details</option><option value="usage">API Usage &amp; Charges</option><option value="wallet">Wallet Transactions</option><option value="bonus">Signup Bonus Credits</option></select></label></div><div class="field"><label>Customer<select name="id" data-customers data-all></select></label></div><div class="field"><label>From date<input name="from" type="date" required></label></div><div class="field"><label>To date<input name="to" type="date" required></label></div><button class="primary-action">Download Excel</button></form></div><div data-admin-tables="reports"></div></section><section data-admin-panel="settings" hidden><details><summary>Default Prices, Bonus &amp; Payment Settings</summary><p>Prices and bonus amounts are entered in rupees. Standard price changes apply to existing and new clients using standard pricing. Special rates remain unchanged. Bonus activation never awards credits retroactively.</p><form data-action="settings" class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label>Setting<select name="name"><option value="bonus_active">Bonus Active (1) / Inactive (0)</option><option value="bonus_paise">Signup Bonus (₹)</option><option value="price_returns">Default Return Price (₹, excluding GST)</option><option value="price_challan-monthly">Default Monthly Challan (₹, excluding GST)</option><option value="price_challan-yearly">Default Yearly Challan (₹, excluding GST)</option><option value="price_certificate">Default Certificate (₹, excluding GST)</option><option value="upi_id">UPI ID</option><option value="upi_name">UPI Payee Name</option><option value="payment_notification_email">Primeserve Payment Notification Email</option><option value="supplier_state">Supplier State Code</option></select></label></div><div class="field"><label>Value<input name="value" required maxlength="200"></label></div><button class="primary-action">Save setting</button></form></details><details><summary>Prepaid API Key Management</summary><p>Rotate the backend key here. Its value is never returned to this dashboard. Zoho credentials are configured only in the server environment.</p><form data-action="prepaid-key"><div class="field"><label>New prepaid API key<input name="key" type="password" required maxlength="512" autocomplete="off"></label></div><button class="primary-action">Rotate key</button></form></details><div data-admin-tables="settings"></div></section></section></main><?= view('brand_footer') ?></body></html>
